<title>UK: SIG says yr pretax rises 46 pct.</title>
<headline>SIG says yr pretax rises 46 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21.0		   vs 20.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.8		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.2		    up 9 pct</p>
<p> Pretax		     35.0		   vs 24.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   556.8		  vs 359.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British insulation and related</p>
<p>products group is SIG Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
